    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "Pinecone — Document Loader + Text Splitter\n\nResume stored as a single chunk — not split.\nResumes are 1–2 pages. Splitting fragments the context — skills get separated from experience, name from role history. Vector search then returns incomplete matches and the AI evaluates fragments instead of a full candidate profile.\nSingle chunk = full context preserved on retrieval. Deliberate decision, not a default.",
